---

Parts of this repository come from others and keep their own licenses:

- chips/*.h: Andre Weissflog's chips emulators, zlib license (the notice
  is in each file). chips/m6569.h, m6526.h, m6581.h and z80.h are altered
  versions, marked as such. chips/codegen: the code generator of z80.h
  from the same project (zlib license), altered too.
- chips/c64-roms.h: images of the Commodore 64 ROMs (BASIC, KERNAL,
  character generator). They belong to their copyright holders and are
  not covered by this license.
- chips/zx48-rom.h: the ZX Spectrum 48K ROM, copyright Amstrad plc.
  Amstrad have kindly given their permission for the redistribution of
  their copyrighted material but retain that copyright.
- carts/: Commodore's diagnostic cartridges (Dead Test, Diagnostic
  586220), which belong to their copyright holders, and the ZX Spectrum
  diagnostic ROM (LGPL 3). They are not covered by this license, see
  carts/LICENSE.
- third_party/sokol: zlib license. third_party/nuklear: MIT or public
  domain, at your choice (see the end of nuklear.h).
- src/c64_board_data.c: generated from bwack's C64-250407-Replica-KiCad,
  licensed under the CERN OHL v1.2.
- src/zx48_board_data.c: generated from liveboxandy's KiCad files of the
  ZX Spectrum 48K Issue 3B (CC0 1.0), redrawn from PABB's gerbers.
- src/ula.c is our own model of the Ferranti ULA, checked against the
  gate level netlist of the 6C001 recovered from the die by the
  emu-russia/ula project (CC0), which is not included here: see
  tools/ulacheck.c.
